  "description": "<h2>About the Project</h2>\n<p>Oxford's industry studentships sit within the Autonomous Intelligent Machines and Systems CDT. They support doctoral research linked to AI and intelligent systems, with the scientific project and industry relationship defined by the individual studentship.</p>\n<h2>Research Areas</h2>\n<ul><li>Artificial intelligence</li><li>Robotics</li><li>Autonomous systems</li></ul>\n<h2>Funding and duration</h2>\n<table style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;margin:14px 0;font-size:0.92em;line-height:1.45\"><thead style=\"border:1px solid #d9dee5;background:#eef3fb;padding:8px 10px;text-align:left\"><tr><th scope=\"col\" style=\"border:1px solid #d9dee5;background:#eef3fb;padding:8px 10px;text-align:left\">Component</th><th scope=\"col\" style=\"border:1px solid #d9dee5;background:#eef3fb;padding:8px 10px;text-align:left\">Details</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #d9dee5;padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top\">Award or position</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #d9dee5;padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top\">PhD scholarship / studentship</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #d9dee5;padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top\">Stipend / salary</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #d9dee5;padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top\">Stipend and tuition; exact amount not stated</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2>Eligibility and Requirements</h2>\n<table style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;margin:14px 0;font-size:0.92em;line-height:1.45\"><thead style=\"border:1px solid #d9dee5;background:#eef3fb;padding:8px 10px;text-align:left\"><tr><th scope=\"col\" style=\"border:1px solid #d9dee5;background:#eef3fb;padding:8px 10px;text-align:left\">Criterion</th><th scope=\"col\" style=\"border:1px solid #d9dee5;background:#eef3fb;padding:8px 10px;text-align:left\">Requirement</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #d9dee5;padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top\">Applicant eligibility</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #d9dee5;padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top\">Programme and project criteria apply; see official eligibility guidance</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #d9dee5;padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top\">Further conditions</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #d9dee5;padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top\">Industry-linked AI and robotics projects; project-specific selection.</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2>Application dates</h2>\n<table style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;margin:14px 0;font-size:0.92em;line-height:1.45\"><thead style=\"border:1px solid #d9dee5;background:#eef3fb;padding:8px 10px;text-align:left\"><tr><th scope=\"col\" style=\"border:1px solid #d9dee5;background:#eef3fb;padding:8px 10px;text-align:left\">Component</th><th scope=\"col\" style=\"border:1px solid #d9dee5;background:#eef3fb;padding:8px 10px;text-align:left\">Details</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #d9dee5;padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top\">Recruitment status</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #d9dee5;padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top\">Open</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #d9dee5;padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top\">Deadline / consideration round</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #d9dee5;padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top\">27 January 2027</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #d9dee5;padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top\">Location</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #d9dee5;padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top\">United Kingdom</td></tr><tr></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2>About University of Oxford</h2>\n<p>Oxford offers doctoral research through its departments and colleges. The DPhil is its doctoral qualification, and funded research projects have their own supervision, academic selection and application requirements.</p>\n<p><strong>Official details:</strong> <a href=\"https://aims.robots.ox.ac.uk/study/industry-studentships\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Read the programme or project information</a></p>\n<p><strong>Application route:</strong> <a href=\"https://aims.robots.ox.ac.uk/study/industry-studentships\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Follow the official application instructions</a></p>\n<h2>How to Apply</h2><p>Submit your application through the official portal before the deadline: 27 January 2027. Read the eligibility requirements carefully and prepare all requested documents — early applications are strongly recommended for competitive awards.</p><p><a href=\"https://aims.robots.ox.ac.uk/study/industry-studentships\">Open the official application page ↗</a></p><h2>Application guides</h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"https://nextapply.co.uk/articles/how-to-read-phd-job-advertisement-before-applying\">How to Read a PhD Job Advert: Funding, Eligibility and Application Steps</a></li><li><a href=\"https://nextapply.co.uk/articles/how-to-write-academic-cv-phd-applications-sample\">Academic CV for PhD Applications: Structure and an Example</a></li><li><a href=\"https://nextapply.co.uk/articles/how-to-apply-uk-student-visa-step-by-step-2026-2027\">UK Student Visa Application: CAS, Documents and Financial Evidence</a></li></ul>",
